      "content": "wait what do u mean \"unless you're a literal rock goblin\" lol? anyway, ignore that. im more worried about the \"not disclose\" part. if i use a logic pattern i learned from them, how do i use it without \"disclosing\" it? like, if the code is just in my head, does that count as disclosure if i write it down again later for a different client?",
